		{
			dependencies: ["549ABEB50C4B50DF"]
			description: [
				"\"Once, the Elder Guardian was no monster, it was a sentinel bred, designed to protect their ocean temples and the relics buried within. It was replicated thrice to ensure the secrets kept sunken deep in the monument's catacombs. But the creators of them left their relics forgotten, deciding to keep them elsewhere, the monuments have been abandoned and the guardians were left to die. It strikes at any who approach, mistaking all for the traitors who left their temples to rot...\""
