		{
			can_repeat: true
			dependencies: ["2C52BD9175C8591C"]
			description: [
				"\"Stronger and rarer than its kin, the Yeti rules the highest frozen peaks. A beast of the endothermic energies, it challenges those who dare ascend the heights, leaving only stories of frostbitten bravery in its wake. The others fear these heights. Skor does not. It waits where the air itself tightens. Some say it was once a normal yeti, driven mad by hunger and cold until something broke inside it and kept breaking. Now it is less a creature and more a walking blizzard with teeth...\""
