		{
			dependencies: ["2C5F85A31EC38AD8"]
			description: [
				"\"It was not always a creature of the desert. Once, Sirok's kind slithered through toxic caves, breathing vapors that would kill a mortal in seconds. Then a supreme being dried those caves to dust, and the serpents were left to wither. Most died. A few adapted. They crawled into the dunes and became something new. But they never forgot their roots. They still managed to keep their poisonous and acidic abilities. It's often a prey to the Ancient Remnant, however it still sits pretty high on the food chain...\""
				""
