			description: [
				"\"A drowned mortal like me and you, risen from the frozen seas, she wears a three-bolted diving helmet as her crown. The visor is cracked. The glass is fogged with breath that should have stopped long ago. She does not speak. The water speaks for her. She rules over the Ice Maze, and the disturbing, eldritch marine life she calls family...\""
