		{
			dependencies: ["315796EC3257B63F"]
			description: [
				"\"A former beloved king of the Nether, he ruled upon thousands. One day, everything changed. His lair was infiltrated by overworld soldiers and was threatened for not giving up his people to the superior overworldly civilizations. He had declined, and when war came, he built an emergency fortress. He was killed quickly after, and his soul, combined with the rage of the other not undead people wanted revenge. They fused into the one, the only, Nether's King, and are waiting for visitors to butcher them alive...\""
